[en.FOCUS_C09_COST_OF_PROTECTION_3]
Price of Preservation III

[en.FOCUS_C09_COST_OF_PROTECTION_3_desc]
Preservation comes with prices, but that is the price necessary for the history, no matter how much we regret doing so.

[zh.FOCUS_C09_COST_OF_PROTECTION_3]
传承的代价 III

[zh.FOCUS_C09_COST_OF_PROTECTION_3_desc]
传承是有代价的，但那是为了历史所必须付出的代价，无论我们多么遗憾。

